Comment: 0,0:01:51.43,0:01:53.38,OPJP,,0,0,0,,[Everything reflects the darkness]
Comment: 0,0:02:04.03,0:02:09.10,OPJP,,0,0,0,,真っ暗な街の　表面(うわべ)を飾った
Comment: 0,0:02:09.10,0:02:13.04,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}無数の窓明かり
Comment: 0,0:02:14.25,0:02:19.57,OPJP,,0,0,0,,蒼白い首に　重い鎖巻いて
Comment: 0,0:02:19.57,0:02:23.81,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}そのすべて嘲笑(わら)った
Comment: 0,0:02:24.51,0:02:27.12,OPJP,,0,0,0,,[Everything reflects the darkness]
Comment: 0,0:02:27.12,0:02:29.89,OPJP,,0,0,0,,[When it's inside of my hand]
Comment: 0,0:02:29.89,0:02:32.59,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}[Everything reflects the darkness]
Comment: 0,0:02:33.72,0:02:36.42,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Shadow is the light!!
Comment: 0,0:02:36.39,0:02:40.19,OPJP,,0,0,0,,この運命(さだめ)を背負って
Comment: 0,0:02:40.19,0:02:44.07,OPJP,,0,0,0,,血染まった　記憶の数だけ
Comment: 0,0:02:44.07,0:02:49.28,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}突き刺さった　黒い影を
Comment: 0,0:02:49.28,0:02:54.31,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}すべて壊して　真っ黒なこの手で
Comment: 0,0:02:54.31,0:02:55.44,OPJP,,0,0,0,,I'll never change!!
Comment: 0,0:02:55.44,0:02:57.86,OPJP,,0,0,0,,[Everything reflects the darkness]
Comment: 0,0:02:57.86,0:03:00.41,OPJP,,0,0,0,,[When it's inside of my hand]
Comment: 0,0:03:00.41,0:03:03.16,OPJP,,0,0,0,,[Everything reflects the darkness]
Comment: 0,0:03:03.16,0:03:05.76,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}[Everything reflects the darkness]
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,OPCN
Comment: 0,0:01:51.43,0:01:53.38,OPCN,,0,0,0,,[Everything reflects the darkness]
Comment: 0,0:02:04.03,0:02:09.10,OPCN,,0,0,0,,漆黑昏暗的街道 無數明亮窗戶
Comment: 0,0:02:09.10,0:02:13.04,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}都是被裝飾過的外表
Comment: 0,0:02:14.25,0:02:19.57,OPCN,,0,0,0,,沉重的枷鎖 纏繞在蒼白的頸上
Comment: 0,0:02:19.57,0:02:23.81,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}嘲笑著世界
Comment: 0,0:02:24.51,0:02:27.12,OPCN,,0,0,0,,[Everything reflects the darkness]
Comment: 0,0:02:27.12,0:02:29.89,OPCN,,0,0,0,,[When it's inside of my hand]
Comment: 0,0:02:29.89,0:02:32.59,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}[Everything reflects the darkness]
Comment: 0,0:02:33.72,0:02:36.39,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Shadow is the light!!
Comment: 0,0:02:36.39,0:02:40.19,OPCN,,0,0,0,,背負起這份命運
Comment: 0,0:02:40.19,0:02:44.07,OPCN,,0,0,0,,是一次次染上鮮血的記憶
Comment: 0,0:02:44.07,0:02:49.28,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}那突然襲來的黑暗身影
Comment: 0,0:02:49.28,0:02:54.31,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}用這漆黑的雙手 粉碎殆盡
Comment: 0,0:02:54.31,0:02:55.44,OPCN,,0,0,0,,I'll never change!!
Comment: 0,0:02:55.44,0:02:57.86,OPCN,,0,0,0,,[Everything reflects the darkness]
Comment: 0,0:02:57.86,0:03:00.41,OPCN,,0,0,0,,[When it's inside of my hand]
Comment: 0,0:03:00.41,0:03:03.16,OPCN,,0,0,0,,[Everything reflects the darkness]
Comment: 0,0:03:03.16,0:03:05.76,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}[Everything reflects the darkness]
